# Keep the Docker build context small and keep secrets out of the image
**/.git
**/.vs
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
client
docs
**/*.user
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Real settings files can hold passwords - never bake them into an image
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.*.json

# Uploaded files are runtime data, not part of the image
**/uploads/*
